ture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">SHADOWINFUSION</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSHADOWINFUSION%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CSHADOWINFUSION%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/DisableCombatlog\" title=\"Status properties/DisableCombatlog\">DisableCombatlog</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\">Grants:</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Splinter_Shadow\" title=\"Splinter Shadow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Splinter_Shadows_Icon.webp/40px-Splinter_Shadows_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Splinter_Shadows_Icon.webp/60px-Splinter_Shadows_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Splinter_Shadows_Icon.webp/80px-Splinter_Shadows_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Splinter Shadow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Splinter_Shadows_Icon.webp/40px-Splinter_Shadows_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Splinter_Shadows_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Splinter_Shadow\" title=\"Splinter Shadow\">Splinter Shadow</a> (<span aria-label=\"Reaction\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reaction\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>When you are attacked by a melee attack that does not deal <a href=\"/wiki/Radiant_damage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Radiant damage\">Radiant damage</a>, splinter off a piece of yourself to spawn a new version from the shadows. </dd>\n</dl></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The description of this condition incorrectly states it provides the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Right_Behind_You\" title=\"Right Behind You\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Right_Behind_You_Icon.webp/25px-Right_Behind_You_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Right_Behind_You_Icon.webp/38px-Right_Behind_You_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Right_Behind_You_Icon.webp/50px-Right_Behind_You_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Right Behind You\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Right_Behind_You_Icon.webp/25px-Right_Behind_You_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Right_Behind_You_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Right_Behind_You\" title=\"Right Behind You\">Right Behind You</a> reaction.  It does not, and instead provides the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Splinter_Shadow\" title=\"Splinter Shadow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Portrait_Nimbus.png/25px-Portrait_Nimbus.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Portrait_Nimbus.png/38px-Portrait_Nimbus.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Portrait_Nimbus.png/50px-Portrait_Nimbus.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Splinter Shadow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Portrait_Nimbus.png/25px-Portrait_Nimbus.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Portrait_Nimbus.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Splinter_Shadow\" title=\"Splinter Shadow\">Splinter Shadow</a> reaction.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>SHADOWINFUSION</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Shadow_Infusion\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Infusion_(Hound_of_Ill_Omen)_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Infusion (Hound of Ill Omen) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Splinter_Shadow_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Splinter_Shadow_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Splinter_Shadow_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Splinter_Shadow_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Splinter_Shadow_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Splinter_Shadow_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadow Infusion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Splinter_Shadow_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Splinter_Shadow_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Splinter_Shadow_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Infusion_(Hound_of_Ill_Omen)_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Infusion (Hound of Ill Omen) (Condition)\">Shadow Infusion</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Close to another creature of the shadows. The Hound of Ill Omen has gained the Right Behind You reaction.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Shadow_Infusion\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Infusion_(Accursed_Spectre)_(Condition)\" title=\"Shadow Infusion (Accursed Spectre) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/53/Right_Behind_You_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Right_Behind_You_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Right_Behind_You_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Right_Behind_You_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/53/Right_Behind_You_Cond